The  program provides the hierarchy through the file system name‐
space.  It is possible to browse the tree, query node values  and
modify  them.   By  default, the node contents are interpreted as
ASCII.  If the flag is given, the server uses raw mode  and  dis‐
plays  node  contents  as  they are received from the kernel (bi‐
nary).  The utility first appeared in Raw mode does not currently
support node modification.
